{"title":"When Will My Life Begin","artist":"Tangled","sourceId":"reference:YdefK7qLVQovj17ZvloX","sourceHash":"15f32c08f452da3230057fa6213cda1bc0d81c8faac2ecdfbe7a341d30437957","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":18.19,"end":21.19,"text":"Seven a.m., the usual morning lineup","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":22.26,"end":25.26,"text":"Start on the chores and sweep 'till the floor's all clean","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":26.86,"end":29.86,"text":"Polish and wax, do laundry, and mop and shine up","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.83,"end":33.83,"text":"Sweep again, and by then it's like 7:15","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":35.24,"end":37.34,"text":"And so I'll read a book","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.34,"end":39.63,"text":"Or maybe two or three","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":39.63,"end":42.63,"text":"I'll add a few new paintings to my gallery","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":44.07,"end":46.18,"text":"I'll play guitar and knit","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":46.18,"end":48.7,"text":"And cook and basically","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":48.7,"end":51.7,"text":"Just wonder when will my life begin?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":62.44,"end":65.44,"text":"Then after lunch it's puzzles and darts and baking","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":66.9,"end":69.9,"text":"Paper mache, a bit of ballet and chess","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":71.37,"end":74.37,"text":"Pottery and ventriloquy, candle making","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":75.16,"end":78.16,"text":"Then I'll stretch, maybe sketch, take a climb","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":78.67,"end":79.77,"text":"Sew a dress!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":79.77,"end":82.03,"text":"And I'll reread the books","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":82.03,"end":84.0,"text":"If I have time to spare","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":84.0,"end":86.23,"text":"I'll paint the walls some more","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":86.23,"end":88.4,"text":"I'm sure there's room somewhere","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":88.4,"end":90.42,"text":"And then I'll brush and brush","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":90.42,"end":93.03,"text":"And brush and brush my hair","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":93.03,"end":96.03,"text":"Stuck in the same place I've always been","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":97.44,"end":100.34,"text":"And I'll keep wanderin' and wanderin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":100.34,"end":102.31,"text":"And wanderin' and wonderin'","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":102.31,"end":105.31,"text":"When will my life begin?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":108.46000000000001,"end":111.46000000000001,"text":"And tomorrow night","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":112.28,"end":115.28,"text":"The lights will appear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":116.86,"end":119.86,"text":"Just like they do on my birthday each year","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":126.49,"end":129.49,"text":"What is it like","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":130.67,"end":133.67,"text":"Out there where they glow?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":135.55,"end":138.55,"text":"Now that I'm older","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":139.68,"end":142.24,"text":"Mother might just","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":142.24,"end":145.24,"text":"Let me go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}